+/**
+ * Returns the direction for a short text that may mix Persian/Arabic and Latin
+ * (KMS patch 0022). The first strong character is not trusted: a Persian note
+ * that starts with a Latin word is still Persian. Text with only RTL letters
+ * is RTL, text with only LTR letters is LTR, and text with both takes the
+ * direction of the surrounding block.
+ *
+ * @param text The text to check
+ * @param fallback The direction used when the text has both kinds of letters
+ * @returns "rtl" or "ltr"
